<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">23062026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Iran's chief negotiator declared that the Strait of Hormuz will stay under Tehran's administration, and won't revert to its pre-war status.</s> <s>Ghalibaf said a new thirty-day channel for resolving incidents doesn't replace Iran's requirement that vessels seek its authorization — separating communication from the right of passage itself.</s> <s>The Gulf states whose oil exports cross that water haven't yet answered a claim made over their heads.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The Taliban's supreme leader has approved a four-thousand-strong border corps, the Hebati Unit, to patrol the contested Durand Line.</s> <s>That frontier, drawn by a British colonial officer in eighteen ninety-three and rejected by Kabul ever since, now divides the Taliban from Pakistan as an active armed front.</s> <s>It marks the shift from insurgency to a conventional standing army, aimed squarely at a fellow Muslim neighbor.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Kazakhstan has reversed the direct election of district governors, returning the power to appoint them to the center.</s> <s>Those local akims control patronage and resource distribution across one of Central Asia's largest energy states, and the reform was once held up as proof of post-Nazarbayev maturity.</s> <s>Astana's set no timeline to restore what it's just taken back.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In southern Lebanon, families returning to Nabatieh endured a hundred and fifty Israeli strikes in the war's heaviest night, with at least forty-seven killed, Lebanon's health ministry said.</s> <s>The American-Iranian understanding ended the airstrikes but not the occupation, and Israeli forces remain on the ground.</s> <s>People came home to rebuild around foreign troops who never left.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ukrainian drones struck a missile-electronics plant and a satellite center deep inside Russia, at Voronezh.</s> <s>Kyiv said it was targeting the supply chain itself — the Voronezh plant makes guidance electronics for the cruise missiles falling on Ukrainian cities.</s> <s>Moscow claimed it downed three hundred and one drones, but hasn't disclosed the damage.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In the Indian city of Lucknow, fourteen people died in a fire at an animation studio in the Aliganj district.</s> <s>Dense smoke sealed the stairwells, and survivors lowered themselves on makeshift ropes from the upper floors.</s> <s>Uttar Pradesh's chief minister promised accountability, but no fire-safety audit has been ordered.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Japan will raise its single-entry visa fee fivefold on the first of July, from three thousand yen to fifteen thousand.</s> <s>It's the first increase since nineteen seventy-eight, arriving as the yen hovers near forty-year lows, and permanent-residency fees jump thirtyfold to three hundred thousand yen.</s> <s>The burden lands hardest on the migrant workers from South and Southeast Asia that Japan increasingly depends on.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The United Arab Emirates launched its first retail Treasury sukuk programme, opening Shariah-compliant sovereign debt to ordinary savers.</s> <s>Until now, this government funding channel was limited to large institutions, and retail participation deepens a domestic dirham market that Gulf states are racing to build.</s> <s>It places the Emirates among the small group of sovereigns inviting households directly into their debt.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>China's Commerce Ministry blocked exports to ten American rare-earth miners, including the very firms Washington picked to break Beijing's grip on processing.</s> <s>A separate order barred forty-six American defense contractors from government-linked materials, tightening a chokehold the West has spent years trying to escape.</s> <s>The minerals run through nearly every weapon and electric motor the two powers build.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Alan Greenspan, who chaired the United States Federal Reserve for eighteen years, died on Monday at one hundred.</s> <s>His tenure birthed the so-called Greenspan put — the market's faith that the central bank would always cushion a fall — a doctrine critics link to the two thousand eight crash.</s> <s>He later told Congress he'd made a mistake trusting banks to regulate themselves.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Australia's hundred-million-dollar campaign to eradicate the Varroa mite has failed, four years after it breached the continent's biosecurity.</s> <s>That arrival ended the world's last Varroa-free landmass, and standard pesticide treatments are already losing their effect.</s> <s>The country must now shift from keeping the parasite out to living with a permanent tax on every crop that depends on pollination.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers warn that the air in Karachi now far exceeds World Health Organization limits, with only three percent of the megacity's land left as green cover.</s> <s>Karachi University scientists say development is felling trees while environmental law enforcement is effectively absent.</s> <s>Twenty million people breathe the consequence, and the poorest can least afford to escape it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Scientists in London have traced the body's internal signals back to the individual cells that send them.</s> <s>Organs exchange thousands of protein messages — fat to liver, immune cell to tissue — but until now the sender couldn't be identified; new molecular tags reveal each origin.</s> <s>The method opens a window onto how conversation between organs drives metabolism and disease.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The Five Eyes intelligence alliance warned that frontier artificial intelligence will transform cyber offence within months, not years.</s> <s>They expect attacker capability to outrun patching cycles, and the American cyber agency has already cut its vulnerability-fix deadline for government systems to just three days.</s> <s>Washington has suspended one advanced model for foreign nationals on national-security grounds.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Turkey flew the first live trial of a fighter directing an autonomous drone in formation.</s> <s>Baykar's Kızılelma took off on its own, then flew under the command of a pilot in an Italian-built M-three-forty-six, linked through a datalink in a programme called K-SWARM.</s> <s>Weapons integration and export deals are the next hurdles, in sha'Allah for the engineers chasing them.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Hackers falsified Brazil's national disaster-alert system on Saturday, the platform that warns of floods and landslides.</s> <s>False alarms corrode the very public trust that makes such warnings actionable when a real flood comes.</s> <s>Authorities confirmed a suspected cyberattack, but how the breach happened is still unknown.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>